    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per hour</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in Hovering Stance.</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You can fight while maintaining aerial mobility. When you take any non-subordinate action or any activity up to 3 actions long, such as to Strike or Cast a Spell, you can Step horizontally for each action you spend. You must maintain all requirements for your action or activity throughout your movement, such as range or line of sight requirements, or else your chosen action or activity fails.</span></p>"
